o the house of God in the days of Abiathar the high priest, and did eat the showbread, which is not lawful to eat but for the priests, and gave also to them which were with him?", "words": [[0, 206742], [4, 206920], [7, 207060], [12, 207240], [17, 207460], [21, 207600], [27, 207820], [30, 207980], [34, 208280], [37, 208500], [41, 208580], [46, 208840], [49, 209000], [58, 209740], [62, 209820], [67, 210020], [75, 210960], [79, 211020], [83, 211240], [87, 211500], [91, 211720], [102, 212681], [108, 212852], [111, 212992], [115, 213172], [122, 213572], [125, 213732], [129, 213992], [133, 214312], [137, 214492], [141, 214612], [150, 215592], [154, 215752], [159, 215912], [164, 216272], [167, 216512], [172, 216712], [178, 216932], [183, 217112], [188, 217352]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 218054, "end": 222784, "text": "And he said to them, The sabbath was made for man, and not man for the sabbath:", "words": [[0, 218054], [4, 218184], [7, 218304], [12, 218544], [15, 218744], [21, 219340], [25, 219453], [33, 219813], [37, 220053], [42, 220293], [46, 220473], [51, 220833], [55, 221333], [59, 221553], [63, 221913], [67, 222093], [71, 222213]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 223234, "end": 226267, "text": "Therefore the Son of man is Lord also of the sabbath.", "words": [[0, 223234], [10, 223496], [14, 223716], [18, 223976], [21, 224076], [25, 224396], [28, 224656], [33, 224916], [38, 225436], [41, 225716], [45, 225836]]}]}